  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1468",
    "issue_date": "2026-11-10T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-10T12:25:20.694Z",
    "meteorologist": "Binu Maharjan",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा पश्चिमी वायूको आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ ।",
    "analysis_en": "The country is currently under the partial influence of westerly winds.",
    "today_np": "देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्ने र बाँकी भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। तराई भू-भाग, उपत्यका तथा खोँचहरूमा बिहानपख थोरै स्थानमा हुस्सु/कुहिरो लाग्नेछ। कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका साथै  कोशी प्रदेशको पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ।",
    "today_en": "Partly cloudy conditions will prevail over the Himalayan and Hilly regions of the country, while the weather will remain mainly fair over the rest of the country. Fog/mist is likely at a few places over the Terai region, valleys, and river basins during the early morning. There is a possibility of light rain/snowfall at one or two places in the Himalayan regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces, as well as in the Hilly region of Koshi Province.",
    "tomorrow_np": "कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ। बाँकी हिमाली भू-भाग, देशका पहाडी भू-भागका साथै  मधेश प्रदेशमा आंशिक बादल लाग्ने तथा बाँकी तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा तथा लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षाको सम्भावना छ। मधेश तथा कोशी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षाको सम्भावना छ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions will prevail over the Himalayan regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces. The remaining Himalayan regions, Hilly regions of the country, and Madhesh Province will experience partly cloudy conditions, while the weather will remain mainly fair over the remaining Terai regions. There is a possibility of light rain/snowfall accompanied by thunder/lightning at a few places in the Himalayan regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces, and at one or two places in the Himalayan regions of Lumbini, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces. Similarly, light rain accompanied by thunder/lightning is likely at one or two places in the Hilly regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces, as well as in the Terai regions of Madhesh and Koshi Provinces.",
    "special": ""
  }
}
